WEBVTT

00:00:14.343 --> 00:00:16.423
So, how long were you in here?

00:00:16.623 --> 00:00:17.983
I don't know.
Couple years.

00:00:18.383 --> 00:00:21.303
I didn't wanna sit on a shelf
waiting for my life to happen.

00:00:21.503 --> 00:00:22.463
So, I left.

00:00:22.823 --> 00:00:23.823
WOODY: Wow.

00:00:23.983 --> 00:00:26.223
You've handled this lost toy
life better than I could.

00:00:26.663 --> 00:00:28.143
Aw, Sheriff.

00:00:28.303 --> 00:00:30.103
You're selling yourself short.

00:00:32.063 --> 00:00:34.383
I think you'd make
a great lost toy.

00:00:35.903 --> 00:00:36.943
You really don't think

00:00:37.023 --> 00:00:38.823
you'll ever be in a kid's room
again, huh?

00:00:38.983 --> 00:00:39.983
(STRAINING) Nope.

00:00:40.183 --> 00:00:41.623
And now with the carnival
traveling through,

00:00:41.703 --> 00:00:42.743
it's our chance
to hop a ride...

00:00:42.903 --> 00:00:44.943
-and leave town.
-You're leaving?

00:00:45.103 --> 00:00:46.103
Sure am.

00:00:46.263 --> 00:00:48.343
You ever think about getting
out there, seeing the world?

00:00:48.503 --> 00:00:50.183
Without a kid? (CHUCKLES)

00:00:50.263 --> 00:00:53.143
No. You can't teach
this old toy new tricks.

00:00:53.223 --> 00:00:55.223
(CHUCKLES) You'd be surprised.

00:00:56.623 --> 00:00:59.663
So, how'd you end up in
this store in the first place?

00:00:59.823 --> 00:01:02.103
Well, I saw your lamp
in the window...

00:01:02.263 --> 00:01:05.743
and I thought maybe
you were inside...

00:01:05.903 --> 00:01:07.863
and so I, uh...

00:01:11.783 --> 00:01:12.943
Wow.

00:01:13.943 --> 00:01:15.183
Yeah.

00:01:15.743 --> 00:01:17.263
Will you look at that?

00:01:18.903 --> 00:01:21.903
This is the only part
of the store I ever liked.

00:01:29.823 --> 00:01:32.863
That's gonna be quite a jump
for you and Duke.

00:01:32.943 --> 00:01:34.223
(CHUCKLES)

00:01:34.303 --> 00:01:35.503
For me?

00:01:40.023 --> 00:01:41.463
Didn't I tell you?
You're going with him.

00:01:41.583 --> 00:01:42.543
I am?

00:01:43.583 --> 00:01:44.743
Let's caboom.

00:01:44.863 --> 00:01:46.303
It'll be fine,
Duke's the best.

00:01:46.463 --> 00:01:47.983
Yeah, at crashing.

00:01:52.143 --> 00:01:53.343
And now!

00:01:54.303 --> 00:01:55.543
(BUZZING)

00:01:55.623 --> 00:01:56.663
Go!

00:01:56.743 --> 00:01:57.743
WOODY: Whoa!

00:01:57.823 --> 00:01:58.823
(GASPING)

00:02:05.303 --> 00:02:07.183
Huh? Rejean.

00:02:07.343 --> 00:02:09.903
DUKE: It's a commercial.
It's not real!

00:02:10.063 --> 00:02:12.143
I can't do this!
I'm sorry, Rejean!

00:02:12.463 --> 00:02:13.943
(GASPS) No, no, no!

00:02:19.983 --> 00:02:20.983
(GRUNTS)

00:02:22.823 --> 00:02:24.623
-What's new, pussycat?
-(MEOWS)

00:02:35.463 --> 00:02:36.783
-Forky?
-Girls?

00:02:36.943 --> 00:02:38.623
-Forky, where are you?
-(FORKY CHUCKLING)

00:02:38.783 --> 00:02:40.423
FORKY: You're never
gonna find me.

00:02:40.583 --> 00:02:41.583
Forky?

00:02:42.663 --> 00:02:44.823
(GASPS) Woody!
How'd you find me?

00:02:44.983 --> 00:02:46.783
-Bo, I found him!
-Hi.

00:02:46.943 --> 00:02:49.543
Wait, it's an actual fork?

00:02:49.983 --> 00:02:51.263
Bo! Bo! Bo!

00:02:51.423 --> 00:02:52.983
Buzz!
The dummies are gone!

00:02:53.143 --> 00:02:55.023
What?
Where'd they go?

00:02:56.183 --> 00:02:57.183
(ALL SCREAMING)

00:02:57.263 --> 00:02:58.263
Okay, we can go now!

00:02:58.343 --> 00:03:00.463
-No. I need to find my girls.
-GABBY GABBY: Hello, Woody.

00:03:00.863 --> 00:03:01.863
Hi, Bo.

00:03:02.023 --> 00:03:03.343
-Where are my sheep?
-Yeah!

00:03:03.423 --> 00:03:04.743
Look! Woody found me!

00:03:05.023 --> 00:03:06.943
Take the bunny!
I'm too cute to die!

00:03:09.263 --> 00:03:10.783
BUZZ: Hi-ya!
BUNNY: Oh, no, no!

00:03:10.863 --> 00:03:12.343
(GASPS) Woody!

00:03:12.543 --> 00:03:15.263
-I just wanna talk.
-Yeah, with my voice box!

00:03:16.663 --> 00:03:17.703
-Pull!
-(GRUNTING)

00:03:17.943 --> 00:03:19.183
Whoa!

00:03:19.743 --> 00:03:22.063
VOICE BOX:
You're my favorite deputy.

00:03:22.143 --> 00:03:23.343
(WOODY GASPING)

00:03:23.423 --> 00:03:25.383
Somebody's poisoned
the water hole.

00:03:25.503 --> 00:03:26.903
-I'd like to join your posse.
-(DRAGON YOWLING)

00:03:27.103 --> 00:03:29.223
-(GASPING)
-Reach for the sky!

00:03:29.303 --> 00:03:30.423
(ALL YELLING)

00:03:32.063 --> 00:03:33.063
(PANTING)

00:03:35.783 --> 00:03:36.783
(GASPS)

00:03:40.783 --> 00:03:42.103
-(SHEEP BLEATING)
-Girls!

00:03:42.263 --> 00:03:43.543
Drop it.

00:03:44.183 --> 00:03:45.263
(GRUNTING)

00:03:45.943 --> 00:03:47.263
(FORKY SCREAMING)

00:03:47.343 --> 00:03:48.943
WOODY: No! No!
Forky!

00:03:49.103 --> 00:03:50.183
-We've gotta go!
-Wait!

00:03:51.143 --> 00:03:52.543
-(FORKY WHIMPERING)
-Forky!

00:03:55.183 --> 00:03:56.183
FORKY: Woody!

00:03:58.983 --> 00:04:00.223
(SCREAMS)

00:04:01.183 --> 00:04:02.463
(BLEATING)

00:04:02.543 --> 00:04:03.543
(GASPS)

00:04:07.943 --> 00:04:09.543
(ALL GRUNTING)

00:04:09.623 --> 00:04:10.743
Bonnie's backpack?

00:04:10.823 --> 00:04:12.903
-(DRAGON GROWLING)
-(GASPS)

00:04:13.983 --> 00:04:15.103
Ahh!

00:04:16.303 --> 00:04:17.583
(SCREAMING)

00:04:17.943 --> 00:04:19.303
-Giggle!
-(BOTH EXCLAIM)

00:04:19.383 --> 00:04:20.863
(DRAGON YOWLING)

00:04:21.223 --> 00:04:22.703
Don't let Woody leave!

00:04:25.663 --> 00:04:26.623
Grab on!

00:04:29.903 --> 00:04:31.103
(BOTH YELLING)

00:04:31.303 --> 00:04:32.823
Duke, get us out of here!

00:04:32.983 --> 00:04:33.983
Oui!

00:04:35.023 --> 00:04:36.703
Here, kitty, kitty!

00:04:36.863 --> 00:04:38.543
Wait! We don't have Forky!

00:04:38.703 --> 00:04:39.983
Woody!

00:04:40.383 --> 00:04:41.383
(GASPS)

00:04:43.903 --> 00:04:44.943
WOODY: Forky!

00:04:51.263 --> 00:04:52.583
(DUKE SCREAMS)

00:04:52.663 --> 00:04:53.903
(ALL SCREAMING)

00:04:57.103 --> 00:04:58.263
(GAGGING)

00:04:58.863 --> 00:04:59.943
(GROANS WEAKLY)

00:05:02.663 --> 00:05:03.823
(HISSING)

00:05:04.423 --> 00:05:05.743
Is everyone okay?

00:05:08.023 --> 00:05:09.143
(COUGHING)

00:05:09.223 --> 00:05:11.383
-(BLEATING)
-Shh. It's okay.

00:05:11.583 --> 00:05:13.103
Shh. It's okay.

00:05:13.703 --> 00:05:15.583
Bunny? Bunny?

00:05:16.023 --> 00:05:19.263
(GASPS) Bunny!
No, no, no, no.

00:05:19.463 --> 00:05:21.983
(SOBBING) No, no, no, no.

00:05:23.463 --> 00:05:25.503
-(GASPS) Oh, Bunny!
-It's gonna be okay.

00:05:25.583 --> 00:05:26.583
Forky's still in there.

00:05:26.663 --> 00:05:28.263
If we hurry, we can get him
before they lock him up.

00:05:28.343 --> 00:05:29.623
You want us
to go back in there?

00:05:29.703 --> 00:05:30.903
We barely got out alive.

00:05:31.103 --> 00:05:32.343
Woody, it's better if we wait.

00:05:32.463 --> 00:05:33.863
No, no, no. There's no time.
We can easily get back inside.

00:05:33.943 --> 00:05:34.943
But I saw Bonnie's...

00:05:35.023 --> 00:05:36.103
By my count, there were
only four dummies.

00:05:36.183 --> 00:05:37.183
But the backpack...

00:05:37.263 --> 00:05:38.303
We outnumber them.
So we have the advantage.

00:05:38.383 --> 00:05:39.703
Woody, look at us!

00:05:41.703 --> 00:05:42.703
(SHEEP BLEATING)

00:05:42.783 --> 00:05:45.863
Nobody is with you.
It's over, okay?

00:05:46.023 --> 00:05:48.183
No. No, no, no. We are
wasting time. We can do this.

00:05:48.343 --> 00:05:50.183
BUNNY: Come on, Pull-string.
GIGGLE: It's not worth it.

00:05:50.263 --> 00:05:51.303
Yeah, yes, listen to her!

00:05:51.463 --> 00:05:53.223
-Nobody wants this!
-I do!

00:05:53.303 --> 00:05:54.423
-BO PEEP: Why?
-Because!

00:05:54.623 --> 00:05:56.343
-Why?
-Just because!

00:05:56.463 --> 00:05:57.423
Why?

00:05:57.543 --> 00:05:58.823
Because it's all
I have left to do!

00:06:01.623 --> 00:06:03.343
I don't have anything else.

00:06:04.783 --> 00:06:06.383
So, the rest of us
don't count?

00:06:07.543 --> 00:06:09.423
That's not what I meant.

00:06:09.583 --> 00:06:10.943
Bonnie needs Forky.

00:06:11.103 --> 00:06:13.543
No. You need Bonnie!

00:06:13.703 --> 00:06:14.943
Open your eyes, Woody.

00:06:15.023 --> 00:06:16.943
There's plenty of kids
out there.

00:06:17.143 --> 00:06:21.183
It can't be just about the one
you're still clinging to.

00:06:21.343 --> 00:06:23.183
It's called loyalty.

00:06:23.343 --> 00:06:25.183
Something a lost toy
wouldn't understand.

00:06:26.463 --> 00:06:27.463
(GASPS SOFTLY)

00:06:33.183 --> 00:06:35.223
I'm not the one who's lost.

00:06:36.823 --> 00:06:37.983
Let's get out of here.

00:06:38.143 --> 00:06:40.663
We've got a carnival
that leaves in the morning.

00:06:40.823 --> 00:06:42.103
Come on.

00:06:42.303 --> 00:06:43.583
DUCKY: Mmm-hmm.

00:06:43.663 --> 00:06:44.903
We'll find our own kid.

00:06:45.063 --> 00:06:46.463
You're crazy.

00:06:49.103 --> 00:06:50.143
Bo!

00:06:50.503 --> 00:06:53.583
BO PEEP: Bye, Woody.
Good luck with Bonnie.

